sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BO as Bosta
    participant WR as Webhook Receiver
    participant IB as Inbox
    participant SH as Shipment Handler
    participant SM as Item State Machine
    participant FE as Financial Engine
    participant LD as Vendor Ledger
    participant SP as Shopify
    participant DSH as Dashboards

    Note over BO,DSH: Requirement 3.3, 3.4, 12.3 - live status without manual refresh

    BO->>WR: POST shipment status<br/>(Picked Up / In Transit / Out For Delivery / Delivered / Returned / Failed)
    WR->>WR: verify signature
    WR->>IB: persist (dedupe on external event id)
    WR-->>BO: 200 OK

    IB->>SH: dispatch
    SH->>SH: map courier status -> internal status
    SH->>SM: transition(order_item, newStatus)

    alt transition is legal
        SM->>SM: write ITEM_STATUS_HISTORY
    else illegal transition (out-of-order webhook)
        SM->>SM: reject, log anomaly, keep current state
        Note right of SM: Couriers deliver events out of order.<br/>The state machine is the guard -<br/>never trust arrival order.
    end

    alt status = Delivered
        SH->>FE: recognise revenue for the item
        FE->>LD: post SALE (credit vendor)<br/>post COMMISSION (debit vendor)
        Note right of LD: Vendor becomes payable only<br/>on delivery, not on dispatch.
    else status = Failed Delivery
        SH->>DSH: add to FD recovery queue
        Note right of DSH: 3,743 FD items in 7 months -<br/>this queue is where the<br/>recovered revenue comes from.
    else status = Returned / RTO
        SH->>FE: trigger return valuation
        FE->>LD: post RETURN_REVERSAL<br/>(reverses the SALE entry)
        Note right of LD: Requirement 8.7 - a paid-out item<br/>that later returns is deducted<br/>from the next settlement.
    end

    opt Bosta flex shipping compensation
        BO->>WR: flex ship / compensation event
        WR->>SH: dispatch
        SH->>FE: record compensation against the item
        FE->>FE: reduce effective shipping cost
        Note right of FE: Requirement 3.4 - 3,181 items<br/>carried Apply FlexShip.<br/>Currently reconciled by hand.
    end

    SH->>SP: sync final status back to Shopify
    SH->>DSH: refresh read models (live)
